'''Pulsing Aura''' (Japanese: '''波動ビート''' ''Aura Beat'') is the sixth {{TCGP|B Series}} expansion, and the seventeenth expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Pulsing Aura''' is the seventh main expansion released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It focuses on {{p|Lucario|Mega Lucario}}.

